# steps/table-receiver.md §10: k is a field of the root of the part unit_s7_part_root_field_part.lm2 (harness
# Parts) -- the lexical space of the part's methods, not of the source's code.  m, a method of the source, reads
# k: a free name of m, bound by its callers (the book :1178); none binds it -- "unresolved name" at m's read, in
# the source.  Bound by name to the part's field, m would read 5.
fn: m () size_t
return: k
size_t: a 0U
a: m()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
